		<div class="uabb-adv-accordion-item"
			data-index="0">
		<div class="uabb-adv-accordion-button uabb-adv-accordion-buttonphf5vzdclito uabb-adv-after-text" aria-selected="false" role="tab" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="expandable">
						<h6 class="uabb-adv-accordion-button-label" >What happens if I don’t secure my .au domain extension?</h6>
			<div class="uabb-adv-accordion-icon-wrap" ><i class="uabb-adv-accordion-button-icon fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>		</div>
		<div class="uabb-adv-accordion-content uabb-adv-accordion-contentphf5vzdclito fl-clearfix uabb-accordion-desc uabb-text-editor" aria-expanded="true" >
			<p>Unfortunately, it means someone else can. You have until September 2022 to reserve the .au direct match of your domain. After September 2022 your .au domain is open to anyone, including your competitors, to purchase. <a href="https://www.auda.org.au/au-domain-names/au-direct/priority-allocation-process">You can learn more here.</a></p>
		</div>
	</div>
		<div class="uabb-adv-accordion-item"
			data-index="1">
		<div class="uabb-adv-accordion-button uabb-adv-accordion-buttonphf5vzdclito uabb-adv-after-text" aria-selected="false" role="tab" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="expandable">
						<h6 class="uabb-adv-accordion-button-label" >Am I eligible for a .au domain?</h6>
			<div class="uabb-adv-accordion-icon-wrap" ><i class="uabb-adv-accordion-button-icon fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>		</div>
		<div class="uabb-adv-accordion-content uabb-adv-accordion-contentphf5vzdclito fl-clearfix uabb-accordion-desc uabb-text-editor" aria-expanded="true" >
			<p>To be eligible you must have an Australian presence.<br>If you already have a .au extension associated with a domain, you will have preference when registering the new .au extension associated with that domain. For example, if you already have "yourbusiness.com.au" or "yourbusiness.net.au", you will have preference for "yourbusiness.au". <a href="https://www.auda.org.au/au-domain-names/au-direct/priority-allocation-process">You can lean more here.</a></p>
		</div>
	</div>
		<div class="uabb-adv-accordion-item"
